@b <https://example.org/lattice/odrl/mapping#>
@p odrl=<http://www.w3.org/ns/odrl/2/>
@p vcard=<http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#>
@p ins=<https://www.nebularis.org/neuro-semantic/lattice/instrument#>
@p pty=<https://www.nebularis.org/neuro-semantic/lattice/party#>
@p elg=<https://www.nebularis.org/neuro-semantic/lattice/eligibility#>
%R Source fm mork:RDF lb "ODRL 2.2 policies"
%X
odrl:Agreement RE
%T Concepts in Source
PolicyConcept C ra odrl:Agreement
PermissionConcept C p odrl:permission
ProhibitionConcept C p odrl:prohibition
ObligationConcept C p odrl:obligation
DutyConcept C p odrl:permission/odrl:duty
RemedyConcept C p odrl:prohibition/odrl:remedy
PermAssignee C p ^odrl:permission/odrl:assignee
PermAssigner C p ^odrl:permission/odrl:assigner
ProhAssignee C p ^odrl:prohibition/odrl:assignee
ProhAssigner C p ^odrl:prohibition/odrl:assigner
OblAssignee C p ^odrl:obligation/odrl:assignee
OblAssigner C p ^odrl:obligation/odrl:assigner
DutyAssignee C p ^odrl:duty/^odrl:permission/odrl:assignee
DutyAssigner C p ^odrl:duty/^odrl:permission/odrl:assigner
RemAssignee C p ^odrl:remedy/^odrl:prohibition/odrl:assignee
RemAssigner C p ^odrl:remedy/^odrl:prohibition/odrl:assigner
%M Scheme md mork:ReviewMode lb "an ODRL policy to a stated term with its permission, prohibitions, obligations and remedy" sdl [odrl <http://www.w3.org/ns/odrl/2/>]
Role_T MD xt pty:Role c role
Role_T_Label M cb Role_T xr rdfs:label v "party"
Policy MD f PolicyConcept xt ins:Term,ins:Template c term
Permission MD cb Policy f PermissionConcept xt ins:Permission,ins:Template xr ins:arisesUnder c permission w 80 n "An ODRL permission is a liberty, so an ins:Permission."
Permission_Activity M cb Permission xr ins:activity r odrl:action
Permission_Holder MD cb Permission tp Role_T f PermAssignee xi ins:holder
Permission_Counterparty MD cb Permission tp Role_T f PermAssigner xi ins:counterparty
Implied MD cb Permission xt ins:Prohibition,ins:Template xi ins:excepts ct "implied-prohibition/${odrl:action}" n "The prohibition the permission excepts (law I8)."
Implied_Term MD cb Implied xt ins:Term,ins:Template xi ins:arisesUnder ct "implied-term/${odrl:action}"
Implied_Activity M cb Implied xr ins:activity r odrl:action
Implied_Obligor MD cb Implied tp Role_T f PermAssignee xi ins:obligor
Implied_Obligee MD cb Implied tp Role_T f PermAssigner xi ins:obligee
Prohibition MD cb Policy f ProhibitionConcept xt ins:Prohibition,ins:Template xr ins:arisesUnder c prohibition w 85 n "An ODRL prohibition is a duty not to act, so an ins:Prohibition."
Prohibition_Activity M cb Prohibition xr ins:activity r odrl:action
Prohibition_Obligor MD cb Prohibition tp Role_T f ProhAssignee xi ins:obligor
Prohibition_Obligee MD cb Prohibition tp Role_T f ProhAssigner xi ins:obligee
Remedy MD cb Prohibition f RemedyConcept xt ins:Obligation,ins:Template xr ins:arisesOnBreachOf c remedy w 75 n "ODRL remedy is what must be done on breach of the prohibition. The remedy's own parties are taken as the prohibition's."
Remedy_Term MD cb Remedy xt ins:Term,ins:Template xi ins:arisesUnder c remedy-term
Remedy_Activity M cb Remedy xr ins:activity r odrl:action
Remedy_Obligor MD cb Remedy tp Role_T f RemAssignee xi ins:obligor
Remedy_Obligee MD cb Remedy tp Role_T f RemAssigner xi ins:obligee
Obligation MD cb Policy f ObligationConcept xt ins:Obligation,ins:Template xr ins:arisesUnder c obligation w 70 n "A policy-level ODRL obligation has no stated obligee, so the assigner is assumed."
Obligation_Activity M cb Obligation xr ins:activity r odrl:action
Obligation_Obligor MD cb Obligation tp Role_T f OblAssignee xi ins:obligor
Obligation_Obligee MD cb Obligation tp Role_T f OblAssigner xi ins:obligee
Duty MD cb Policy f DutyConcept xt ins:Obligation,ins:Template xr ins:arisesUnder c duty w 55 n "A duty of a permission is owed by the assignee for the permission to apply. Linking it to the permission (ins:fulfilledWhen) is not done, so uncertain."
Duty_Activity M cb Duty xr ins:activity r odrl:action
Duty_Obligor MD cb Duty tp Role_T f DutyAssignee xi ins:obligor
Duty_Obligee MD cb Duty tp Role_T f DutyAssigner xi ins:obligee
